This is the required directory structure

speech_translation/
├── app.py                     # Main Flask app
├── utils.py                   # All processing logic: whisper, translate, etc.
├── env310/                    # Your virtual environment (if no default)
│
├── static/                    # For CSS, JS, etc.
│   └── style.css              # Optional
│
├── templates/                 # Jinja2 HTML templates
│   └── index.html             # Frontend with form + dropdown



